<title>USA: Robertson Cty, Tenn., won by First Union Capital.</title>
<headline>Robertson Cty, Tenn., won by First Union Capital.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1996-12-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>First Union Capital Markets Corp., said it won $6.600 million of Robertson Cty, Tenn., general obligation school bonds, Series 1996, with a true interest cost of 4.90 percent.</p>
</text>
